"Detect and prevent abuse, multi-accounting, and suspicious activity\"}),d.jsx(\"li\",{children:\"Enforce bans and suspensions across accounts and devices\"}),d.jsx(\"li\",{children:\"Monitor service health and investigate errors\"}),d.jsx(\"li\",{children:\"Improve user experience and optimize our tools\"}),d.jsx(\"li\",{children:\"Analyze usage patterns to enhance functionality\"})]})]}),d.jsxs(\"section\",{children:[d.jsx(\"h2\",{className:\"text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-3\",children:\"4. Automated Flagging & Moderation\"}),d.jsx(\"p\",{className:\"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",children:\"We use automated systems to flag accounts that exhibit suspicious behavior. Flags may be generated based on shared IP addresses with banned users, shared browser fingerprints, shared device identifiers, unusual request patterns, or verification anomalies. Flagged accounts are reviewed by administrators and may result in restrictions. Administrators can also add manual notes and flags to accounts.\"})]}),d.jsxs(\"section\",{children:[d.jsx(\"h2\",{className:\"text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-3\",children:\"5. Third-Party Services\"}),d.jsx(\"p\",{className:\"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-2\",children:\"We use third-party services that may collect information:\"}),d.jsxs(\"ul\",{className:\"list-disc list-inside text-muted-foreground space-y-1 ml-4\",children:[d.jsxs(\"li\",{children:[d.jsx(\"strong\",{children:\"Discord OAuth:\"}),\" Used for authentication. Subject to Discord's privacy policy.\"]}),d.jsxs(\"li\",{children:[d.jsx(\"strong\",{children:\"Roblox API:\"}),\" We query public Roblox data to provide inventory viewing and player lookup features.\"]})]}),d.jsx(\"p\",{className:\"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mt-2\",children:\"These services have their own privacy policies, and we encourage you to review them.\"})]}),d.jsxs(\"section\",{children:[d.jsx(\"h2\",{className:\"text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-3\",children: